  * [`get_nonce`](#get_nonce)
  * [`set_public_key`](#set_public_key)
  * [`is_valid_signature`](#is_valid_signature)
  * [`__execute__`](#__execute__)
  * [`is_valid_eth_signature`](#is_valid_eth_signature)
  * [`eth_execute`](#eth_execute)
  * [`_unsafe_execute`](#_unsafe_execute)
