### Task:
- Now, please generate the code for the following functionality:

Generate a webapp for product recommendation by searched tags using the Rails framework that corresponds to the following OpenAPI schema:
```

openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: Recommendation
  description: Product recommendation service to provide a list of posted products searched by tag.
  version: 1.0.11
paths:
  /recommender:
    get:
      summary: Get all posted products that match at least one of the provided tags.
      parameters:
        - in: query
          name: tags
          schema:
            type: string
